Before acting, read `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT.md`, and the active approved plan in `.aisdf/plans/` when present. Treat PROJECT.md as product truth and AGENTS.md as operating rules. For assessment, remain read-only. Do not edit source until the human has approved the plan and exact file allowlist. Preserve existing Cursor rules and user changes. Run relevant checks and report actual evidence; never claim unrun tests.
